        "y0": 0.3067565802440507,
        "x1": 0.8169496167607668,
        "y1": 0.32095503637173395
      },
      "text": "The restriction to fl • 1 in Theorem 3 was made just for simplicity.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1544977781151523,
        "y0": 0.32391217089039126,
        "x1": 0.8168986344537815,
        "y1": 0.3381106270180745
      },
      "text": "If the source term has higher spatial regularity, and if further conditions of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15449752166491595,
        "y0": 0.3410677615367319,
        "x1": 0.8169480267693014,
        "y1": 0.35526621766441513
      },
      "text": "the type (15) are fulfllled, then we can also show higher temporal order of",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15449818843553045,
        "y0": 0.35822335218307244,
        "x1": 0.8170183967141544,
        "y1": 0.37242180831075566
      },
      "text": "convergence. The additional conditions can be derived by expanding the defect",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1544981371454832,
        "y0": 0.375378942829413,
        "x1": 0.8170156270516019,
        "y1": 0.3895773989570962
      },
      "text": "in (16) even further, and it can be shown as in Lemma 3 that they are implied",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.15449885520614495,
        "y0": 0.39254522550134363,
        "x1": 0.8169062766708246,
        "y1": 0.40674368162902685
      },
      "text": "by the underlying quadrature rule being of higher order. In particular, full",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
